# Diagnostic boolean checks — never printed or sliced, rendered by gate.sh.
# tray-void:        recess probe ∩ tray — empty iff the recess is actually cut
#                   (a solid-capped tray survived every printability gate; NOTES
#                   iteration 5). The control uses the same probe on a tray with
#                   no cavity difference — must interfere, or the empty check
#                   is unfalsifiable.
# div-cover:        thin slab on the 2×1 cell boundary ∩ bin-2x1-div — must
#                   interfere (divider present and covering the span). The
#                   control runs the same slab on an open bin — must be empty.
tray-void        empty
tray-void-ctrl   interferes
div-cover        interferes
div-cover-ctrl   empty
